
Step 1: Launch & Connect

Launch EC2 t3.large with Amazon Linux 2023

Connect:

ssh -i your-key.pem ec2-user@<EC2_PUBLIC_IP>

🔹 Step 2: Update & Install Basics
sudo yum update -y
sudo yum install -y curl git --allowerasing

🔹 Step 3: Install Ollama
curl -fsSL https://ollama.com/install.sh | sh
ollama --version

🔹 Step 4: Pull a Model
ollama pull tinyllama
ollama list

🔹 Step 5: Create Workspace
mkdir ~/yaml_demo && cd ~/yaml_demo

🔹 Step 6: Create Broken YAML
vi broken_deployment.yaml




🔹 Step 7: Create Debug Script
vi debug_yaml.sh


(this script will read broken_deployment.yaml, send it to Ollama, and save fixed output)

Make it executable:

chmod +x debug_yaml.sh

🔹 Step 8: Run Debug Script
./debug_yaml.sh

🔹 Step 9: View Fixed YAML
cat fixed_deployment.yaml

